### RabbitMQ Management HTTP API requests for manually testing the worker.
### Requires the VS Code "REST Client" extension (humao.rest-client).
### Defaults match docker-compose.yaml (user phoenix / phoenix, vhost "/").

@host = localhost
@mgmtPort = 15672
@vhost = %2F
@queue = v3_logs

### Basic auth for phoenix:phoenix (base64 "cGhvZW5peDpwaG9lbml4").
@auth = Basic cGhvZW5peDpwaG9lbml4

### Publish a mail-flow message (type header "fuglu").
POST http://{{host}}:{{mgmtPort}}/api/exchanges/{{vhost}}/amq.default/publish
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{auth}}

{
  "properties": {
    "content_type": "application/json",
    "headers": { "type": "fuglu" }
  },
  "routing_key": "{{queue}}",
  "payload": "{\"euid\":\"e-0001\",\"from_email_id\":\"alice@example.com\",\"to_email_ids\":[\"bob@example.org\"],\"email_domains\":[\"example.org\"],\"subject\":\"Hello\",\"type\":\"Incoming\",\"status\":\"Accepted\",\"status_description\":\"250 OK\",\"log_timestamp\":\"2026-01-01T10:00:00+05:30\",\"email_timestamp\":\"2026-01-01 10:00:00.123456\",\"meta_data\":{\"size\":1234}}",
  "payload_encoding": "string"
}

### Publish an audit message (type header "audit").
POST http://{{host}}:{{mgmtPort}}/api/exchanges/{{vhost}}/amq.default/publish
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{auth}}

{
  "properties": {
    "content_type": "application/json",
    "headers": { "type": "audit" }
  },
  "routing_key": "{{queue}}",
  "payload": "{\"organization_id\":\"org_123\",\"user_id\":\"user_456\",\"message\":\"User logged in\",\"action_type\":\"login\",\"action_timestamp\":\"2026-01-01T10:00:00+05:30\",\"details\":{\"ip\":\"203.0.113.7\"}}",
  "payload_encoding": "string"
}

### Peek at messages without consuming them (requeues after read).
POST http://{{host}}:{{mgmtPort}}/api/queues/{{vhost}}/{{queue}}/get
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{auth}}

{
  "count": 5,
  "ackmode": "ack_requeue_true",
  "encoding": "auto"
}

### Check queue depth / consumer count.
GET http://{{host}}:{{mgmtPort}}/api/queues/{{vhost}}/{{queue}}
Authorization: {{auth}}

### Count stored rows in ClickHouse (HTTP interface).
GET http://{{host}}:8123/?query=SELECT%20count()%20FROM%20mail_flow_logs
X-ClickHouse-User: default
X-ClickHouse-Key: changeme
